  "notes": [
    "This is a pre-0.5.0 measurement on a degenerate universe (single-species per arm, scripted strategies). It is not a balance claim; release-plan.md forbids balance claims before 0.5.0.",
    "SATURATION (S4, 2026-10-08): referenceGrimoires is read from the observation's grimoireCount channel, which clamps at 4096 (agent-api layout.ts). referenceGrimoires@portal-rush reads exactly 4096 with standard error 0 and tolerance 0: every run saturated, so the line is a floor, not a measurement, and the gate is blind to it in both directions. referenceGrimoires@passive-control reads 4080.6 (SE 15.4): most runs saturated, so its tolerance understates the true spread. gate-power.test.ts counts a line at the clamp as blind (BLIND_ARM_LINES). Reading the count from state instead of the clamped observation is a census change (scenario/src/census.ts reads only the observation, by contract) and is left as a follow-up."
